[TITLE]
NUM-51: junction J1 takes 1 cfs carrying TSS = 10, TP = 20, COD = 40 and
BOD = 20 mg/L. The treatment equations raise a negative number to a power:
  TP   C = (TSS - 13)^2       = (-3)^2       = 9
  COD  C = 30 + (TSS - 12)^3  = 30 + (-2)^3  = 22
  BOD  C = 5 + (TSS - 14)^0.5 : (-4)^0.5 is not a real number; like
       sqrt() of a negative number it must evaluate to 0, so BOD = 5.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         KINWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             01:00:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         30
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J1      2     5         0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev  Type
O1      0     FREE

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  From  To  Length  Roughness  InOffset  OutOffset  InitFlow
C1      J1    O1  400     0.013      0         0          0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link  Shape     Geom1  Geom2  Geom3  Geom4  Barrels
C1      CIRCULAR  1      0      0      0      1

[POLLUTANTS]
;;Name  Units  Crain  Cgw  Crdii  Kdecay  SnowOnly  CoPollut  CoFrac  Cdwf  Cinit
TSS     MG/L   0      0    0      0       NO        *         0       0     0
TP      MG/L   0      0    0      0       NO        *         0       0     0
COD     MG/L   0      0    0      0       NO        *         0       0     0
BOD     MG/L   0      0    0      0       NO        *         0       0     0

[DWF]
;;Node  Constituent  Baseline
J1      FLOW         1
J1      TSS          10
J1      TP           20
J1      COD          40
J1      BOD          20

[TREATMENT]
;;Node  Pollutant  Function
J1      TP         C = (TSS - 13)^2
J1      COD        C = 30 + (TSS - 12)^3
J1      BOD        C = 5 + (TSS - 14)^0.5

[REPORT]
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
